### Maven shade plugin build byproduct (infra/lambdas/*) ###
# Auto-regenerated by every `mvn package` run - not source, shouldn't be committed.
dependency-reduced-pom.xml

### Terraform (infra/terraform) ###
# .tfvars is where the real SendGrid key / FCM service-account JSON / DB password get passed in
# (see infra/terraform/variables.tf) - never committed. State files can also embed those same
# secrets in plaintext once `terraform apply` has run. .terraform.lock.hcl is NOT ignored here -
# that one's meant to be committed (it just pins provider versions, no secrets in it).
**/.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
*.tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
